WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:03.503
Welcome to Vanderpump Dogs.

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:08.216
We created this rescue center

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:11.636
and with our incredible team,
we have found homes for more

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.679
than two thousand dogs.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.306
This is Hermie.

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:16.057
Mary.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:17.392
It's like a dating process.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.351
This is Larry.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:22.105
You wanna have a little foreplay
before you go all the way.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.149
This is Angel.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:24.858
This is Knight.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.984
This is Violet.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:26.818
What did you think?

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.194
I want three dogs.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.488
That's a lot of
picking up poop.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:31.740
I'll take one.

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:36.703
The goal is to make these
dogs feel like VIPs.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.997
LVP's VIPs.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.667
A Vanderpuff entails
shampoos, brushouts, 

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:45.462
then I go into places
your barber doesn't go.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:48.923
This is Duke.

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:51.092
Oh my god, that
looks like my husband.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.220
I'm sure I married
you 38 years ago.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:56.890
We have to be sure

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.267
that this is the best
option for the dog.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:02.312
I feel ready for it.

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:08.610
It's not about just finding
somebody attractive

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.702
across the bar.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.154
This isn't a one-night stand.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:13.031
This is a life-long relationship.

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:16.618
I am just so happy that he's
going to be my forever dog.

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:18.578
I couldn't have asked
for anything better.

